{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1513781-ufo-and-aliens-in-modern-trinity","id":1513781,"title":"UFO and Aliens in 'modern' Trinity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-03T09:30:38-07:00","id":1513781,"title":"UFO and Aliens in 'modern' Trinity","content":"If UFOs sighting in 2023 were true in <b>Trinity Continuum</b> - What gameline alien race would it be?<br /> <br /> In real world, we have flooding with reports confirming UFOs - NASA and Pentagon are sweating over them lately...<br /> <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/nasa-panel-hold-first-public-meeting-ufo-study-ahead-report-rcna86993\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/pol...port-rcna86993</a>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-03T09:39:46-07:00","id":1513783,"title":"","content":"I suspect that <i><b>NOER</b></i> from <b>Players Guide</b> are first to investigate those cases? As NOER were created after 'not!Rosewell incident'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T06:24:22-07:00","id":1514007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1513781-ufo-and-aliens-in-modern-trinity#post1513781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If UFOs sighting in 2023 were true in <b>Trinity Continuum</b> - What gameline alien race would it be?<br /> <br /> In real world, we have flooding with reports confirming UFOs - NASA and Pentagon are sweating over them lately...<br /> <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/nasa-panel-hold-first-public-meeting-ufo-study-ahead-report-rcna86993\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/pol...port-rcna86993</a>\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> Actually, I have been tinkering with this concept in the Heroic Age setting over at my <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/heroic-age-air-84111403\" target=\"_blank\">blog </a>(more articles pending). I will be digging into the subject soon, so stay tuned. This is a great deal of fun to play with.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">INSPIRED SPACE RACE (Alternate History)</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">In the Heroic Age, space travel, aliens and the exploration of space is a widely known and accepted reality. So much so that many average citizens consider the subject to be \u201cboring,\u201d preferring docudramas, politics and other pop-culture schlock more captivating. The presence of Inspired adventurers and Inventors has pushed scientific discovery into space, resulting in a far more ambitious and successful state of affairs than what we have in our universe.</span><br /> \u200b<br /> <b>FRIENDLY ALIENS</b><br /> There a number of &quot;friendly&quot; aliens out there, some of whom have established trade relations with Earth. The friendliest of them are members of the Arcturian Collective (aka Family of Light or Starseeds), which is a <i>seemingly </i>benevolent version of the Coalition. They are in opposition to the Children of Darkness (the Echthroi) who are all Quantum Users (and not necessarily bad). The Arcturian Collective representatives can be a bit preachy (universal love, blah, blah), but they <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">share technology, philosophy and (Ahem!) genetic material with Earthlings with some regularity.</span>\u200b<br /> Known member species are:<br /> \u200b<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Almas (Drones)-</b> These shy aliens are helpful and very strong. Often lumped in with Yowies.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Greys (Envoys)-</b> Often in the employ of ICC. They have a large base in the Zeti Reticuli system.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Mantids (Spinals)-</b> This insectoid species is violent and rationally-oriented. Can live anywhere.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Yowies </b><b>(Sasq)- </b>These furry technicians are found on scattered colonies, ships and stations.</span>\u200b<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":1756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","user":"MythAdvocate","date":". 06-07-2023, 07:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T07:59:49-07:00","id":1514013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1513781-ufo-and-aliens-in-modern-trinity#post1513781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If UFOs sighting in 2023 were true in <b>Trinity Continuum</b> - What gameline alien race would it be?<br /> <br /> In real world, we have flooding with reports confirming UFOs - NASA and Pentagon are sweating over them lately...<br /> <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/nasa-panel-hold-first-public-meeting-ufo-study-ahead-report-rcna86993\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/pol...port-rcna86993</a>\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>One thing to consider is that in our world, drones are a thing. No admiral wants to have to explain that an AEGIS destroyer was sunk because the terrorists flying the drone packed with C-4 made built it to look like a flying saucer.<br /> <br /> Also, Aeon is an era of interstellar travel and humanity is probably the leading &quot;known&quot; race when it comes to that. If an unregistered Cessna comes into US airspace the reaction is less likely &quot;OH NOES! The aliens is gonna invade and probe our buttocks!&quot; so much as &quot;Those morons are probably running drugs.&quot;<br /> <br /> Figure the assumption on spotting a genuine UFO in human territory is &quot;It's an Aberrant.&quot; instead of &quot;ET has finally come back for more Reese's Pieces.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T05:15:37-07:00","id":1514826,"title":"","content":"I'm building a Core Trinity campaign structure where the Hammersmith Event went a different direction, so there is no Aberrant continuity in the prospective timeline. Since there is no Noetic pulse, the Doyen only see the Sol system as something to look in on eventually and don't care what is happening.<br /> <br /> With no Doyen interference there is no barrier between Earth and the greater cosmos, so I'm playing with the idea of having interdimensional and extrasolar life be plot elements (depending on what direction my players go). This left me with the Coalition and their Progenitors as my aliens of choice, as well as some still developing Elder Things that burrow into worlds by making psionic bridges through cultists.<br /> <br /> Now, if I were to introduce some kind of UFO crash storyline, escaped Coalition slave stock seem to be the most likely 'canon' source for a game set in modern era. The beings can be hostile, inadvertently toxic, new allies, or tragic deaths with hints of something bigger without needing to explore a full invasion plot. It can also present some of the Fermi Paradox elements talked about in Aeon depending on how you want to build the tone of your game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27972-gm-janus","name":"GM Janus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-11T06:32:38-07:00","id":1520382,"title":"","content":"Some TV series inspirations on topic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <a href=\"https://tvshowpilot.com/fun-posts/best-alien-tv-shows/\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvshowpilot.com/fun-posts/best-alien-tv-shows/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-11T21:58:25-07:00","id":1523989,"title":"","content":"Video of 'UFO crazy' of 2023 - and how scientific it is. \ud83d\ude32 <a href=\"https://youtu.be/28syNShynJw?si=Bpdt-sb6_HaaokVC\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/28syNShynJw?si=Bpdt-sb6_HaaokVC</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"